    category: "novenas",
    day: 6,
    intention: "To trust in God's miraculous power",
    text: `O Saint Martin de Porres, you who performed countless miracles during your lifetime and after your death, intercede for me today. You healed the sick with a touch of your hand, you raised the dead to life, you multiplied food for the hungry, and you bilocated to be present in distant places. These miracles were not performed for your own glory but for the glory of God and for the consolation of the suffering. I bring before you my own needs today, trusting that God who worked miracles through you can work miracles in my life as well. Whether the miracle I need is physical healing, spiritual renewal, the conversion of a loved one, or the resolution of an impossible situation, I place it in your hands, confident in your powerful intercession. O Saint Martin, worker of miracles, obtain for me the help I need from God. Amen.`,
