    title: "Day 8 — The Patron of Social Justice",
    category: "novenas",
    day: 8,
    intention: "To work for a just and compassionate society",
    text: `O Saint Martin de Porres, patron of social justice, you who dedicated your life to serving the marginalized and the oppressed, inspire me today to work for a more just and compassionate society. You did not merely feel sympathy for the poor — you took action. You organized charitable works, you established institutions of mercy, and you used your influence to advocate for those who had no voice. Help me to move beyond good intentions to concrete action. Whether through volunteering, through advocacy, through charitable giving, or through prayer, help me to do my part in building a society where every person is treated with dignity, where the basic needs of all are met, and where justice and mercy flow like a river. O Saint Martin, patron of social justice, help me to be Christ's hands and feet in the world today. Amen.`,
